# Line endings: the repository stores LF, and every checkout gets LF too,
# regardless of core.autocrlf. Tests that read sources as strings (source
# asserts, golden reports) must not depend on the machine (ERROR_LOG
# 21.09.2026, closing V4.7).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never convert.
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary

# Golden reports are compared byte for byte (V4.7, B0).
tests/fixtures/** -text